# ==============================================================================
# SMB PORTAL - SCOPED ENVIRONMENT ARCHITECTURE
#
# This monorepo uses SCOPED environment files instead of a single universal .env:
#
# 1. API Service (NestJS)  -> apps/api/.env (template: apps/api/.env.example)
#    - PORT (default: 3001)
#    - DATABASE_URL / MONGODB_URI
#    - JWT_SECRET & JWT_EXPIRES_IN
#    - FRONTEND_URL (CORS allowed origin)
#    - STRIPE_SECRET_KEY & STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET
#
# 2. Web Frontend (Next.js) -> apps/web/.env.local (template: apps/web/.env.example)
#    - PORT (default: 3000)
#    - NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
#    - API_URL (internal proxy rewrite)
#    - NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME
#
# Each workspace manages its own secrets without configuration bleeding across apps.
# ==============================================================================
